OL,3,GNEWSAMemory man aims to learn Pi to
OL,4,A70,000 decimal places
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with an incredible memory is
OL,7,Fhoping to get into the record books by
OL,8,Flearning Pi to 70,000 decimal places.
OL,10,FTom Morton, from Lytham in Lancashire,
OL,11,Fsaid his neurodiverse mind "thinks
OL,12,Foutside the box" and "numbers to me are
OL,13,Flike a language" which he learns by
OL,14,Fassociating them with mental images.
OL,16,FThe 61-year-old said he hoped to
OL,17,Fcomplete the challenge - which will
OL,18,Ftake 10 hours in front of 10
OL,19,Finvigilators - after "seven or eight
OL,20,Fmonths" of training.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
